  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/DataDog/datadog-lambda-python/zipball/v8.130.0",
  "body": ">[!IMPORTANT]\r\n> For Python 3.8 and 3.9: `dd-trace-py` version is [v3.19.9](https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-py/releases/tag/v3.19.9)\r\n> For Python >= 3.10: `dd-trace-py` version is [v4.16.0](https://github.com/DataDog/dd-trace-py/releases/tag/v4.16.0)\r\n\r\n\r\n>[!IMPORTANT]\r\n> This layer is currently unavailable in aws region `me-south-1`, due to unrelated incidents\r\n\r\n## What's Changed\r\n* Bump to v8.130.0dev0 by @rithikanarayan in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-python/pull/868\r\n* fix(deps): vuln brace-expansion (patch → 1.1.21) [tests/integration/package.json] by @gh-worker-campaigns-3e9aa4[bot] in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-python/pull/869\r\n* fix(deps): vuln shell-quote (minor → 1.12.0) [tests/integration/package.json] by @gh-worker-campaigns-3e9aa4[bot] in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-python/pull/865\r\n* Disable unittest and selenium to fix error log by @rithikanarayan in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-python/pull/873\r\n* v130 upgrade by @rithikanarayan in https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-python/pull/874\r\n\r\n\r\n### Layers\r\n```\r\n# AWS Commercial\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python38:130\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python38-ARM:130\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python39:130\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python39-ARM:130\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python310:130\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python310-ARM:130\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python311:130\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python311-ARM:130\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python312:130\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python312-ARM:130\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python313:130\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python313-ARM:130\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python314:130\r\narn:aws:lambda:<AWS_REGION>:464622532012:layer:Datadog-Python314-ARM:130\r\n\r\n# AWS GovCloud \r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python38:130\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python38-ARM:130\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python39:130\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python39-ARM:130\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python310:130\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python310-ARM:130\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python311:130\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python311-ARM:130\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python312:130\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python312-ARM:130\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python313:130\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python313-ARM:130\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python314:130\r\narn:aws-us-gov:lambda:us-gov-<AWS_REGION>:<ACCOUNT>:layer:Datadog-Python314-ARM:130\r\n\r\nACCOUNT =\r\n002406178527 for us1 environment\r\n486696501492 for us2 environment\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/DataDog/datadog-lambda-python/compare/v8.129.0...v8.130.0",
